{"schemaVersion":2,"root":{"fen":"rnbakabnr/9/1c5c1/p1p1p1p1p/9/9/P1P1P1P1P/1C5C1/9/RNBAKABNR w - - 0 1","comment":"六十年代开始，辽宁棋手曾多次访问上海，与以胡荣华为首的上海棋手交锋，下出了不少顺炮名局。文化大革命开始后，全国象棋活动陷入停顿，棋手也都被分配干了别的工作。全国的象棋活动从1972年开始逐步恢复，到1973年各种交流比赛已经十分活跃。。1973年10月－11月，沈阳和哈尔滨方面联合举办了上海、沈阳、哈尔滨三城市象棋邀请赛，在与沪沈大战中，孟立国、韩福德、郭长顺、黄成俊等名将与上海队大斗顺炮，并在顺炮两头蛇对双横车、顺炮横车对直车和顺炮缓开车等布局方面都下出了新的变化。在胡荣华先行对孟立国的对局中，胡荣华开局禁子得力，中局孟平炮边陲导致失子，胡荣华得子后以精巧的战术化去黑方攻势，在沪辽斗炮战中再续了精彩的篇章。\r\n","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i0h0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i9i8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i8d8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g3g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9c7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c3c4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a9a8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0h5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d8d3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c0a2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a8f8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2b4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f8f1","comment":"进车下二路，看似凶悍，但实际作用不大，可改走卒5进1。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d0e1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h5h8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d3c3","comment":"红方不吃卒，也伸车下二路，逼开了黑方可能有的埋伏。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a0c0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g5g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b4g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7f5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h8f8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e7f7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"